WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.660
This one is about publishing.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.720
You wrote a good page.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.440
But search engines and AI assistants
cannot find it, and nobody shares it.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.040
Here, your text files become a real site.

5
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:30.287
With cards for sharing, icons, and
what search engines and assistants read.

6
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.837
And the page can read itself aloud,
one highlighted sentence at a time.

7
00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:48.525
The secret: the voice and the page
are checked against each other.

8
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:53.760
If they ever disagree, it refuses.
It never points at the wrong line.

9
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:59.400
This is its own documentation,
narrated and published by itself.

10
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

11
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
